      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maz’ umuhungu wiwe Yehoshafati asubira ku ngoma yiwe; araheza yīgira agahambaye, arindana n’Abisirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.11.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 11:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.15.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "15:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ashira ingabo mu bisagara vyose vy’i Buyuda bizitiriwe inzitiro z’amabuye, akwiragiza amaboma mu gihugu c’i Buyuda no mu bisagara vy’i Bgefurayimu, ivyo se Asa yihesheje umuheto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uhoraho abana na Yehoshafati, kuko yagendera mu ngeso sekuruza Dawidi yagendeyemwo uhereye ubga mbere, ntaje gusiguza za Bayali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.12.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Abam 12:30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "arikw agasiguza Imana ya sekuruza, akagendera mu vyagezwe vyayo, ntāgendere mu ngeso z’ Abisirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.18.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 18:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni co catumye Uhoraho akomeza ingoma yiwe; Abayuda bose bamuzanira imishikīro; agira ubutunzi bginshi n’icubahiro gihambaye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.20.33"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Ngo 20:33",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umutima wiwe ugenda ushira ubgoba mu nzira z’Uhoraho, akūra mu Buyuda ibitabo vyatabge mu mpinga z’imisozi n’inkingi zashingiwe Ashera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.17.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
